"Grievance ticket volume over time, split into closed/resolved and "
"open/active."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:277
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:291
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:301
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:314
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:323
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:329
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:344
msgid "HOPE grievances — country report grievance feed."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:279
msgid ""
"Counts tickets by created date. Ignored tickets are excluded and business "
"area must be set. Closed covers the Closed and Resolved statuses; Open & "
"Active covers New, Assigned, In Progress, On Hold and For Approval."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:284
msgid ""
"HOPE integer status codes are mapped to labels before charting. System flags"
" are a separate source and are excluded by default; use the ticket-source "
"toggle to include them."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:290
msgid "Grievance tickets by status."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:292
msgid ""
"Counts tickets by the status value for the active ticket source and period."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:294
msgid ""
"Not specified means the source status field was blank. The doughnut is used "
"until resolution-time data is available, when it is replaced by Average "
"Grievance Resolution Time by Category."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:300
msgid "Average grievance resolution time by category."
msgstr "Délai moyen de résolution des plaintes par catégorie."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:303
msgid ""
"Average days between ticket creation and last update for closed tickets "
"(status 6) created in the selected period, grouped by category. updated_at "
"is used as the closure proxy because HOPE does not expose a dedicated "
"closure timestamp."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:308
msgid ""
"Only closed tickets with both timestamps are included. The status doughnut "
"is shown instead until resolution rows exist."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:313
msgid "Grievance tickets by priority."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:315
msgid ""
"Counts tickets by the priority value for the selected period and country."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:317
msgid ""
"Priority is an optional field in HOPE, so many tickets have none; these are "
"reported as Not Set (source value 0)."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:322
msgid "Grievance tickets by category."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:324
msgid ""
"Counts tickets by the category value for the selected period and country."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:325
msgid ""
"The chart shows the top 10 categories. Not specified means the category was "
"blank."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:328
msgid "Grievance tickets by subcategory."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:331
msgid ""
"Counts tickets by the subcategory value (stored as issue_type in HOPE) for "
"categories that define subcategories: Data Change, Sensitive Grievance, "
"Grievance Complaint and Needs Adjudication."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:336
msgid ""
"The chart shows the top 10 subcategories. Payment Verification, feedback, "
"referral, system-flagging and beneficiary categories have no subcategory and"
" are excluded, so the chart total is lower than total tickets. HOPE calls "
"this field Subcategory."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:343
msgid ""
"Grievance tickets by country, split into closed/resolved and open/active."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:346
msgid ""
"Uses the same ticket base as the grievance timeline, grouped by business "
"area country. Each bar is the stacked total of closed/resolved and "
"open/active tickets."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:349
msgid ""
"All countries with tickets in the period are shown; long country names wrap "
"on the axis."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:356
msgid ""
"Global delivery over time: cash disbursed, payment count, and the number of "
"individuals, households and children reached by household programmes."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:359
msgid ""
"HOPE payments and household registration data, aggregated by the country "
"report."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:361
msgid ""
"Total Cash Disbursed sums delivered quantity in USD. Payments Count counts "
"payment records — not payment plans, unique recipients or only completed "
"payments. Individuals Reached sums the registered household size of reached "
"households; Households Reached counts those households; Children Reached "
"sums the children recorded in household composition. Frontline (incentive) "
"workers are reported separately and are not part of these series."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:369
msgid ""
"All years is the default. Last 5 years shows the current year and the "
"previous four. Selecting a year shows its monthly data. Where a year or "
"month has no demographic record, the reached series are estimated from "
"payment volume."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:375
msgid "Share of cash assistance delivered by programme sector."
msgstr "Part de l'assistance en espèces fournie par secteur du programme."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:378
msgid ""
"Sums delivered quantity in USD for the selected year and country, grouped by"
" programme sector. The chart shows the largest sectors and groups the "
"remainder as Other."
msgstr ""
"Additionne la quantité fournie en USD pour l'année et le pays sélectionnés, "
"par secteur du programme. Le graphique présente les principaux secteurs et "
"regroupe le reste sous « Autre »."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:382
msgid "Percentages are of total cash delivered in the selected scope."
msgstr ""
"Les pourcentages portent sur le total des espèces fournies dans le périmètre"
" sélectionné."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:385
msgid "Share of cash assistance delivered by payment mechanism."
msgstr "Part de l'assistance en espèces fournie par mécanisme de paiement."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:388
msgid ""
"Sums delivered quantity in USD for the selected year and country, grouped by"
" delivery mechanism. The chart shows the largest mechanisms and groups the "
"remainder as Other."
msgstr ""
"Additionne la quantité fournie en USD pour l'année et le pays sélectionnés, "
"par mécanisme de paiement. Le graphique présente les principaux mécanismes "
"et regroupe le reste sous « Autre »."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:392
msgid ""
"Payment mechanism is the HOPE delivery mechanism attached to the payment."
msgstr ""
"Le mécanisme de paiement correspond au mécanisme de livraison HOPE associé "
"au paiement."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:395
msgid "Children reached through household programmes in the current data."
msgstr ""
"Enfants atteints dans le cadre des programmes ménages dans les données "
"actuelles."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:396
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:409
#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:422
msgid ""
"HOPE household registration and payment data — country report demographic "
"feed."
msgstr ""
"Données d'enregistrement des ménages et de paiement HOPE — flux "
"démographique du rapport pays."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:398
msgid ""
"Sums the children recorded in the composition of reached households. A "
"household is counted when it has at least one qualifying payment in the "
"period; the children count follows the household's recorded composition."
msgstr ""
"Additionne les enfants enregistrés dans la composition des ménages atteints."
" Un ménage est compté lorsqu'il a au moins un paiement admissible sur la "
"période ; le nombre d'enfants suit la composition enregistrée du ménage."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:403
msgid ""
"Where household composition or children's dates of birth are missing, the "
"figure is understated. This is not an estimate of all children in need."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque la composition du ménage ou les dates de naissance des enfants "
"manquent, le chiffre est sous-estimé. Il ne s'agit pas d'une estimation de "
"tous les enfants dans le besoin."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:408
msgid "Families with at least one qualifying payment in the selected period."
msgstr ""
"Familles ayant au moins un paiement admissible sur la période sélectionnée."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:411
msgid ""
"Counts reached households distinctly. Qualifying payments must belong to "
"accepted, finished or closed payment plans; failed, removed, conflicted and "
"excluded payments are not included."
msgstr ""
"Compte distinctement les ménages atteints. Les paiements admissibles doivent"
" appartenir à des plans acceptés, terminés ou clôturés ; les paiements "
"échoués, supprimés, en conflit et exclus ne sont pas inclus."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:416
msgid ""
"Families are counted from standard (household) programmes; social-worker "
"programmes are reported separately."
msgstr ""
"Les familles sont comptées dans les programmes standards (ménages) ; les "
"programmes de travailleurs sociaux sont présentés séparément."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:421
msgid "People reached through household programmes in the current data."
msgstr ""
"Personnes atteintes dans le cadre des programmes ménages dans les données "
"actuelles."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:424
msgid ""
"Sums the registered household size of reached households. A household is "
"counted when it has at least one qualifying payment in the period, using the"
" delivery date, then the entitlement date, then the payment status date."
msgstr ""
"Additionne la taille enregistrée des ménages atteints. Un ménage est compté "
"lorsqu'il a au moins un paiement admissible sur la période, selon la date de"
" livraison, puis la date d'ayant droit, puis la date de statut du paiement."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:428
msgid ""
"Frontline (incentive) workers are reported separately and are not part of "
"this figure."
msgstr ""
"Les travailleurs de première ligne (incitations) sont présentés séparément "
"et ne font pas partie de ce chiffre."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:431
msgid "Cash disbursed directly to beneficiaries in the current data."
msgstr ""
"Espèces versées directement aux bénéficiaires dans les données actuelles."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:434
msgid ""
"Sums delivered quantity in USD, grouped by sector to avoid double counting. "
"Entitlement quantity is used only when a delivery amount is not recorded."
msgstr ""
"Additionne la quantité fournie en USD, par secteur pour éviter les doubles "
"comptages. La quantité due n'est utilisée que lorsqu'un montant livré n'est "
"pas enregistré."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:437
msgid ""
"The figure covers direct cash transfers, not the full operational budget."
msgstr ""
"Le chiffre couvre les transferts monétaires directs, pas l'ensemble du "
"budget opérationnel."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:440
#| msgid "Cash disbursed directly to beneficiaries in the current data."
msgid "Number of cash transfers delivered in the current data."
msgstr "Nombre de transferts en espèces effectués dans les données actuelles."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:443
msgid ""
"Sums payment records grouped by sector to avoid double counting. A payment "
"record is not a unique recipient or a payment plan."
msgstr ""
"Additionne les enregistrements de paiement regroupés par secteur pour éviter"
" les doubles comptages. Un enregistrement de paiement ne correspond pas à un"
" bénéficiaire unique ni à un plan de paiement."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:446
msgid ""
"Average transfer value divides cash disbursed by the number of payment "
"records."
msgstr ""
"La valeur moyenne du transfert divise les espèces décaissées par le nombre "
"d'enregistrements de paiement."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:449
msgid "Frontline social workers assisted through social-worker programmes."
msgstr ""
"Travailleurs sociaux de première ligne aidés dans le cadre des programmes de"
" travailleurs sociaux."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:450
msgid ""
"HOPE social-worker programme records — country report demographic feed."
msgstr ""
"Enregistrements des programmes de travailleurs sociaux HOPE — flux "
"démographique du rapport pays."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:452
msgid ""
"Sums the beneficiaries recorded for social-worker programmes. In these "
"programmes each record represents one worker, so the beneficiary total is "
"the workforce count."
msgstr ""
"Additionne les bénéficiaires enregistrés pour les programmes de travailleurs"
" sociaux. Dans ces programmes, chaque enregistrement représente un "
"travailleur ; le total des bénéficiaires correspond donc à l'effectif."

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:455
msgid ""
"Social-worker programmes are not part of household, children or persons-"
"with-disabilities counts."
msgstr ""
"Les programmes de travailleurs sociaux ne font pas partie des chiffres sur "
"les ménages, les enfants ou les personnes handicapées."

